fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstvalue.html#gst_value_unique_list_concat","fragment":"\n\tgst_value_unique_list_concat\n\n\n\tGst.ValueUniqueList.prototype.concat\n\n\n\tGst.ValueUniqueList.concat\n\nConcatenates copies of value1 and value2 into a set.  Values that are not\nof type GST_TYPE_UNIQUE_LIST are treated as if they were sets of length 1.\ndest will be initialized to the type GST_TYPE_UNIQUE_LIST.\nParameters:\nan uninitialized GValue to take the result\na GValue\na GValue\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nConcatenates copies of value1 and value2 into a set.  Values that are not\nof type GST_TYPE_UNIQUE_LIST (not introspectable) are treated as if they were sets of length 1.\ndest will be initialized to the type GST_TYPE_UNIQUE_LIST (not introspectable).\nParameters:\na GObject.Value\na GObject.Value\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nConcatenates copies of value1 and value2 into a set.  Values that are not\nof type GST_TYPE_UNIQUE_LIST (not introspectable) are treated as if they were sets of length 1.\ndest will be initialized to the type GST_TYPE_UNIQUE_LIST (not introspectable).\nParameters:\na GObject.Value\na GObject.Value\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});